WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.097 --> 00:00:03.619
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03.935 --> 00:00:06.255
This is Episode 57.

3
00:00:06.485 --> 00:00:08.465
Maya's line is slow.

4
00:00:08.866 --> 00:00:10.918
Every cup takes forever.

5
00:00:11.246 --> 00:00:12.230
But why?

6
00:00:12.655 --> 00:00:13.384
Oh no!

7
00:00:13.748 --> 00:00:15.533
Here comes the glow string.

8
00:00:15.788 --> 00:00:17.416
It ties onto a lemon.

9
00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:18.776
And follows it.

10
00:00:19.043 --> 00:00:20.415
Into the squeezer.

11
00:00:20.792 --> 00:00:21.557
Orange!

12
00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:22.371
Thick!

13
00:00:22.638 --> 00:00:23.852
Squeak, squeak.

14
00:00:24.144 --> 00:00:25.152
Slow here!

15
00:00:25.456 --> 00:00:26.597
Into the pitcher.

16
00:00:26.889 --> 00:00:27.557
Yellow.

17
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:28.625
Fast.

18
00:00:28.856 --> 00:00:29.828
Into the cup.

19
00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:30.726
Yellow.

20
00:00:31.006 --> 00:00:31.734
Fast.

21
00:00:31.929 --> 00:00:32.864
To the friend.

22
00:00:33.095 --> 00:00:33.641
Yellow.

23
00:00:33.848 --> 00:00:34.613
Fast.

24
00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.641
Only one slow spot.

25
00:00:36.932 --> 00:00:38.025
The squeezer!

26
00:00:38.341 --> 00:00:40.345
Maya gets a big new one.

27
00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:41.292
Whoosh!

28
00:00:41.596 --> 00:00:43.806
Now the string is yellow everywhere.

29
00:00:44.074 --> 00:00:45.859
The line moves fast.

30
00:00:46.114 --> 00:00:47.255
Follow the path.

31
00:00:47.498 --> 00:00:48.895
Find the slow spot.

32
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:49.952
Fix it.

33
00:00:50.243 --> 00:00:51.883
That is the glow string.

34
00:00:52.138 --> 00:00:54.117
Now you know X-Ray!

35
00:00:54.227 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
